bas-ui (1.0.2) testing; urgency=medium

  * Add bas.security: ACManager, CredentialManager, wxLoginUi sign-in dialog,
    and tanks RBAC demo with policy helpers.
  * Add guitanks demo: simulation state/tick logic, wx GUI with shortcuts,
    policy panel, and streamline SVG toolbar icons.
  * Add wx_compat for wxWidgets 3.0 vs 3.1+ (menu/toolbar bitmaps, AUI link
    suffix from wx_logic); fix guitanks wx 3.0 crashes and panel flicker.
  * Integrate gettext i18n pipeline and localize core UI labels.
  * Migrate to AssetsRegistry with OverlapVolume zip embedding; move wx and
    nanosvg into Meson subprojects; relocate sources under src/bas.
  * UI architecture: IdManager, BitmapResult, CreateViewContext fragment layout,
    unified toolbar abstraction, state-driven notepad editing; fragment views
    return wxWindow*.
  * Image loading: optional readFileOpt, reason-aware bitmap fallbacks, clearer
    missing-vs-empty asset diagnostics.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Wed, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000

bas-ui (1.0.1) testing; urgency=medium

  * Refactor image loading: add wx/images module with imageLoadAsset, imageLoadFile,
    renderSvgToWxImage (nanosvg); ImageSet delegates to it, BitmapMode.include_raw.
  * UI frame/fragment lifecycle: uiFrame uses addFragment() + createView();
    UIFragment createFragmentView/destroyFragmentView, elements().
  * Centralize ID allocation: BuildViewContext.getNextId(); UIStateValueDescriptor
    id(context) for menu/tool IDs; resolveGroup/addToTree take BuildViewContext*.
  * ENUM state: toolbar tools use descriptor icons; findValueById for event handling.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Wed, 18 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000

